   Diquigiovanni, Chiara and Masin, Luca and Rizzardi, Nicola and Cratere,
   Mariapia Giuditta and Boschetti, Elisa and Papa, Valentina and Maresca,
   Alessandra and Cenacchi, Giovanna and Casadio, Rita and Martelli,
   Pierluigi and Matera, Ivana and Ceccherini, Isabella and Fato, Romana
   and Raiola, Giuseppe and Arrigo, Serena and Signa, Sara and Sementa,
